MSUB | cpu_op | U3173 | 11 00 00 01 10 10 01 10 01 | imul - sub | msub dst, s1,s2,s3 | msub dst, s1,s2,s3 | Multiply-subtract
BSWAP | cpu_op | U3174 | 11 00 00 01 10 10 01 10 10 | bswap reg | rev reg, reg | rev reg, reg | Swap byte order
CLZ | cpu_op | U3175 | 11 00 00 01 10 10 10 00 00 | bsr + xor | clz reg, reg | clz reg, reg | Count leading zeros
CTZ | cpu_op | U3176 | 11 00 00 01 10 10 10 00 01 | tzcnt | rbit + clz | rbit + clz | Count trailing zeros
POPCNT | cpu_op | U3177 | 11 00 00 01 10 10 10 00 10 | popcnt dst, src | cnt reg | cnt reg | Population count of bits
ADDS | cpu_op | U3178 | 11 00 00 01 10 10 10 01 00 | add + jo | adds dst, s1, s2 | adds dst, s1, s2 | Add and set status flags
SUBS | cpu_op | U3179 | 11 00 00 01 10 10 10 01 01 | sub + jo | subs dst, s1, s2 | subs dst, s1, s2 | Subtract & set status flags
ASR | cpu_op | U3180 | 11 00 00 01 10 10 10 01 10 | sar | asr | asr | Arithmetic shift right (reg)

